      "t": 15.0,
      "end": 21.95,
      "speaker": "xiaozao",
      "text": "再擦，盾上那点金漆就没了。",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "深夜在朋友身旁坐着，轻声打趣，关心藏在玩笑里。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "gaze": "aoao",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n02",
      "t": 22.0,
      "end": 30.95,
      "speaker": "aoao",
      "text": "金漆掉了能补。明晚要是又挡不住呢？",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "低声答话，手还在擦盾；后半句终于露出白天留下的担忧。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "worry",
        "gaze": "shield",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n03",
      "t": 31.0,
      "end": 36.95,
      "speaker": "xiaozao",
      "text": "今天那一击，你挡住了。",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "平静而确切，提醒朋友一个事实，不是安慰小孩。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "gaze": "aoao",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n04",
      "t": 37.0,
      "end": 47.95,
      "speaker": "aoao",
      "text": "是你们替我补上的。",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "停下手里的活，声音低下来，有些过意不去。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "sad",
        "gaze": "shield",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n05",
      "t": 48.0,
      "end": 55.95,
      "speaker": "xiaozao",
      "text": "所以，你打算一夜不睡，把自己练成三个人？",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "朋友间轻轻反问，前半调侃，最后认真等他回答。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "gaze": "aoao",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n06",
      "t": 56.0,
      "end": 64.95,
      "speaker": "aoao",
      "text": "至少下回，别让你们替我挨打。",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "对身旁朋友坦白，克制地咬住后半句，不喊口号。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "determined",
        "gaze": "xiaozao",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n07",
      "t": 65.0,
      "end": 77.95,
      "speaker": "xiaozao",
      "text": "你老这样，轮到我怕的时候，找谁？",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "这次没有开玩笑，语速稍慢，提出自己也会害怕。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "worry",
        "gaze": "aoao",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n08",
      "t": 78.0,
      "end": 82.95,
      "speaker": "aoao",
      "text": "那就叫我。",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "听懂朋友的意思后抬头，短短一句，认真答应。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "gaze": "xiaozao",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n09",
      "t": 83.0,
      "end": 91.95,
      "speaker": "xiaozao",
      "text": "那你也得叫我们。",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": -3,
        "context": "接住朋友的承诺，声音轻，但末尾坚定。"
      },
      "acting": {
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "gaze": "aoao",
        "camera": "speech"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "t": 92.0,
      "end": 99.95,
      "speaker": "aoao",
      "text": "知道了。你先去睡。",
